msgid "Effective core potentials"
msgstr "有效芯势"

msgid ""
"Pseudopotentials (effective core potentials, ECPs) may be defined at the "
"beginning of ``BASIS`` blocks."
msgstr "赝势（有效芯势，ECP）可以在 ``BASIS`` 块的开始处定义。"

msgid "The general form of the input cards is"
msgstr "输入卡的一般形式为"

msgid ""
"which defines a pseudopotential for an atom specified either by a chemical "
"symbol or a group number. The *ECP specification* may consist either of a "
"single keyword, which references a pseudopotential stored in the library, or"
" else of an explicit definition (extending over several input cards), cf. "
"below."
msgstr ""
"这为通过化学符号或族数指定的原子定义了一个赝势。\\ *ECP specification* "
"可以是一个引用库中存储的赝势的单个关键字，也可以是一个显式定义（跨越多张输入卡），参见下文。"

msgid "Input from ECP library"
msgstr "从 ECP 库输入"

msgid ""
"The basis set library presently contains the pseudopotentials and associated"
" valence basis sets by a) the Los Alamos group (P. J. Hay and W. R. Wadt, "
"`J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.448799>`__ **82**, 270 (1985) "
"and following two papers), and b) the Stuttgart/Köln group (e.g., A. "
"Nicklass, M. Dolg, H. Stoll and H. Preuß, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.468948>`__ **102**, 8942 (1995); for more "
"details and proper references, `click here <http://www.tc.uni-"
"koeln.de/PP/index.en.html>`__). Pseudopotentials a) are adjusted to orbital "
"energies and densities of a suitable atomic reference state, while "
"pseudopotentials b) are generated using total valence energies of a "
"multitude of atomic states."
msgstr ""
"基组库目前包含以下赝势及相关的价层基组：a) Los Alamos 小组（P. J. Hay 和 W. R. Wadt, `J. Chem. Phys."
" <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.448799>`__ **82**, 270 (1985) 及后续两篇论文），以及 b) "
"Stuttgart/Köln 小组（例如，A. Nicklass, M. Dolg, H. Stoll 和 H. Preuß, `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.468948>`__ **102**, 8942 "
"(1995)；更多详情和完整参考文献，请\\ `点击此处 <http://www.tc.uni-"
"koeln.de/PP/index.en.html>`__\\ ）。赝势 a) 是针对合适的原子参考态的轨道能量和密度进行调整的，而赝势 b) "
"则是利用多种原子态的总价层能量生成的。"

msgid ""
"Library keywords in case a) are ``ECP1`` and ``ECP2``; ``ECP2`` is used when"
" more than one pseudopotential is available for a given atom and then "
"denotes the ECP with the smaller core definition. (For Cu, e.g., ``ECP1`` "
"refers to an Ar-like 18\\ :math:`e^-`-core, while ``ECP2`` simulates a Ne-"
"like 10\\ :math:`e^-` one with the :math:`3s` and :math:`3p` electrons "
"promoted to the valence shell). For accurate calculations including electron"
" correlation, promotion of all core orbitals with main quantum number equal "
"to any of the valence orbitals is recommended."
msgstr ""
"情况 a) 的库关键字是 ``ECP1`` 和 ``ECP2``\\ ；当给定原子有多个赝势可用时，使用 ``ECP2``\\ ，它表示具有较小芯定义的"
" ECP。（例如，对于 Cu，\\ ``ECP1`` 指的是类 Ar 的 18\\ :math:`e^-` 芯，而 ``ECP2`` 模拟的是类 Ne "
"的 10\\ :math:`e^-` 芯，其中 :math:`3s` 和 :math:`3p` "
"电子被提升到价层）。对于包含电子相关的精确计算，建议将所有主量子数与任何价层轨道相等的芯轨道都提升。"

msgid ""
"Library keywords in case b) are of the form ``ECP``\\ :math:`nXY`; :math:`n`"
" is the number of core electrons which are replaced by the pseudopotential, "
":math:`X` denotes the reference system used for generating the "
"pseudopotential (:math:`X=S`: states of the single-valence-electron ion; "
":math:`X=M`: states of the neutral atom and of ions with low charge), and "
":math:`Y` stands for the theoretical level of the reference data "
"(:math:`Y=HF`: Hartree-Fock, :math:`Y=WB`: quasi-relativistic; :math:`Y=DF`:"
" relativistic). For one- or two-valence electron atoms :math:`X=S`, "
":math:`Y=DF` is a good choice, while otherwise :math:`X=M`, :math:`Y=WB` (or"
" :math:`Y=DF`) is recommended. (For light atoms, or for the discussion of "
"relativistic effects, the corresponding :math:`Y=HF` pseudopotentials may be"
" useful.) Additionally, spin-orbit (SO) potentials and core-polarization "
"potentials (CPP) are available, to be used in connection with case b) ECPs, "
"but these are not currently contained in the library, so explicit input is "
"necessary here (cf. below)."
msgstr ""
"情况 b) 的库关键词形式为 ``ECP``\\ :math:`nXY`\\ ；\\ :math:`n` 是被赝势替代的芯电子数目，\\ "
":math:`X` 表示生成赝势所用的参考体系（\\ :math:`X=S`\\ ：单价电子离子的态；\\ :math:`X=M`\\ "
"：中性原子和低电荷离子的态），\\ :math:`Y` 代表参考数据的理论级别（\\ :math:`Y=HF`\\ ：Hartree-Fock；\\ "
":math:`Y=WB`\\ ：准相对论；\\ :math:`Y=DF`\\ ：相对论）。对于一价或二价电子原子，\\ :math:`X=S`\\ "
"、\\ :math:`Y=DF` 是良好选择，否则推荐使用 :math:`X=M`\\ 、\\ :math:`Y=WB`\\ （或 "
":math:`Y=DF`\\ ）。（对于轻原子，或讨论相对论效应时，相应的 :math:`Y=HF` 赝势可能有用。）此外，自旋-"
"轨道（SO）势和芯极化势（CPP）也可用，需与情况 b) 的 ECP 结合使用，但这些目前未包含在库中，因此此处需要显式输入（参见下文）。"

msgid ""
"In both cases, a) and b), the same keywords refer to the pseudopotential and"
" the corresponding basis set, with a prefix ``MBS``-…in case a)."
msgstr "在情况 a) 和 b) 中，相同的关键词指代赝势和相应的基组，在情况 a) 中前缀为 ``MBS``-…。"

msgid "Explicit input for ECPs"
msgstr "ECP 的显式输入"

msgid ""
"For each of the pseudopotentials the following information has to be "
"provided:"
msgstr "对于每个赝势，必须提供以下信息："

msgid ""
"V_{ps}= -\\frac{Z-n_{core}}{r} + V_{l_{max}}\n"
"          +\\sum_{l=0}^{l_{max}-1} (V_l-V_{l_{max}}){\\cal P}_{l}\n"
"          +\\sum_{l=1}^{l'{max}} \\Delta V_l {\\cal P}_{l} \\vec{l}\\cdot\\vec{s} {\\cal P}_{l} ;"
msgstr ""
"V_{ps}= -\\frac{Z-n_{core}}{r} + V_{l_{max}}\n"
"          +\\sum_{l=0}^{l_{max}-1} (V_l-V_{l_{max}}){\\cal P}_{l}\n"
"          +\\sum_{l=1}^{l'{max}} \\Delta V_l {\\cal P}_{l} \\vec{l}\\cdot\\vec{s} {\\cal P}_{l} ;"

msgid "V_{l_{max}} = \\sum_{j=1}^{n_{l_{max}}} c_j r^{m_j-2} e^{-\\gamma _j r^2}"
msgstr ""
"V_{l_{max}} = \\sum_{j=1}^{n_{l_{max}}} c_j r^{m_j-2} e^{-\\gamma _j r^2}\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"and the following :math:`n_{l_{max}}` ones giving the parameters in the form"
msgstr "\\ 以及随后的 :math:`n_{l_{max}}` 张卡片以如下形式给出参数"

msgid "m_1, \\gamma _1, c_1; m_2, \\gamma _2, c_2; \\ldots"
msgstr ""
"m_1, \\gamma _1, c_1; m_2, \\gamma _2, c_2; \\ldots\n"
"\n"

msgid "V_l -V_{l_{max}}=\\sum_{j=1}^{n_l} c_j^l r^{m_j^l-2} e^{-\\gamma _j^l r^2}"
msgstr ""
"V_l -V_{l_{max}}=\\sum_{j=1}^{n_l} c_j^l r^{m_j^l-2} e^{-\\gamma _j^l r^2}\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"has to be given, and immediately following :math:`n_l` cards with the "
"corresponding parameters in the form :math:`m_1^l, \\gamma_1^l, c_1^l; "
"m_2^l, \\gamma_2^l, c_2^l;\\ldots`"
msgstr ""
"\\ 必须给出，并紧接着 :math:`n_l` 张卡片，以形式 :math:`m_1^l, \\gamma_1^l, c_1^l; m_2^l, "
"\\gamma_2^l, c_2^l;\\ldots` 给出相应的参数"

msgid ""
"analogously, a number of cards specifying the coefficients of the radial "
"potentials :math:`\\Delta V_l` of the SO part of :math:`V_{ps}`."
msgstr "类似地，若干张卡片指定 :math:`V_{ps}` 的自旋轨道部分径向势 :math:`\\Delta V_l` 的系数。"

msgid "Example for explicit ECP input"
msgstr "显式ECP输入示例"

msgid "Example for ECP input from library"
msgstr "来自库的ECP输入示例"
